OL,3,GNEWSASwimming pool bought by charity
OL,4,Afor #1 reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community pool bought by a charity
OL,7,Ffor #1 has opened for the first time in
OL,8,Fthree years after volunteers secured
OL,9,F#393,000 of funding.
OL,11,FWard Freman Swimming Pool in
OL,12,FBuntingford, Hertfordshire, closed in
OL,13,F2023 after managers East Herts District
OL,14,FCouncil said upgrades had become too
OL,15,Fcostly.
OL,17,FIn May 2026 it was bought by Ward
OL,18,FFreman Community Pool Group, which
OL,19,Ffunded repair work through grants and
OL,20,Fonline fundraising.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
