OL,3,GNEWSASwimming pool bought by charity
OL,4,Afor #1 reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeneral Manager Hazel Sleight said it
OL,7,Ffelt "amazing" to reopen on Saturday,
OL,8,Fand she had been "blown away" by the
OL,9,Fsupport of the local community.
